This project loads and redistributes derived tables of:

  Winding M, Pedigo BD, Barnes CL, Patsolic HG, Park E, Kazimiers T, Fushiki A,
  Andrade IV, Khandelwal A, Valdes-Aleman J, Li F, Randel N, Barsotti E,
  Correia A, Fetter RD, Hartenstein V, Priebe CE, Vogelstein JT, Cardona A,
  Zlatic M. The connectome of an insect brain. Science 379, eadd9330 (2023).
  https://doi.org/10.1126/science.add9330

  as released in the neurodata "bilateral-connectome" repository
  (https://github.com/neurodata/bilateral-connectome), directory data/processed-elife.

Those tables are the work of their authors and are used under their open
license. Nothing here is endorsed by them. The model built on top of them is a
simplification, described in paper/maggots.md and disclosure.md.

Fonts are loaded from Google Fonts under their licenses. Uniswap v4 addresses
and event signatures are public. Market data is read from the Robinhood Chain
public RPC.
